meta {
  name: Ticket Analytics
  type: http
  seq: 14
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/admin/ticket-analytics
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

script:post-response {
  if (res.status === 200) {
    const stages = {};
    res.body.tickets.forEach(t => { stages[t.stage] = (stages[t.stage] || 0) + 1; });
    console.log("✅ Tickets:", res.body.tickets.length, "| Stages:", JSON.stringify(stages));
    console.log("   HODs with teams:", Object.keys(res.body.teamSizeByHod).length, "| Generated:", res.body.generatedAt);
  } else if (res.status === 403) {
    console.log("❌ Access denied — needs SuperUser / Admin / Management / HR DeptHOD");
  } else if (res.status === 401) {
    console.log("❌ Not logged in — run Login first");
  } else {
    console.log("❌", res.body.error);
  }
}

docs {
  # Ticket Analytics

  Powers the dashboard's **Dept-wise Analytics**, **HOD-wise Analytics** and **Performance Charts** tabs.
  Returns one compact row per ticket; the frontend does all grouping, date-range and department filtering.

  **Access:** SuperUser, Admin, Management, or DeptHOD of HR (403 otherwise).
  Broadcast announcements are excluded.

  ## Response

  ```json
  {
    "tickets": [
      {
        "id": 2119,
        "purpose": "Time",
        "requestor": "Lakshmi",
        "requestorEmpId": "AC-1050",
        "dept": "Software",
        "assignedDept": "Software",
        "hodEmpId": "AC-1030",
        "hodName": "Nithish V",
        "hodDept": "Software",
        "stage": "resolved",
        "awaitingAck": false,
        "createdAt": "2026-10-17T09:12:00.000Z",
        "resolvedAt": "2026-10-19T02:00:00.000Z",
        "durationHrs": 40.8
      }
    ],
    "teamSizeByHod": { "AC-1030": 13 },
    "generatedAt": "2026-10-21T10:00:00.000Z"
  }
  ```

  ## Stage (exactly one per ticket — counts always add up to the total)

  | stage | meaning |
  |---|---|
  | `rejected` | any approver (RM / HOD / DeptHOD / Management / assigned RM / assigned HOD) rejected it |
  | `resolved` | resolution submitted (incl. awaiting acknowledgement — `awaitingAck: true`) or closed |
  | `approved` | approved by someone, work still in progress |
  | `pending`  | checking / forwarded, awaiting a decision |
  | `open`     | nobody has acted yet |

  ## Fields

  - `dept` — requestor's department (Raised by); `assignedDept` — handling department (Assigned to)
  - `hodEmpId` / `hodName` / `hodDept` — the **requestor's** HOD (null if none set)
  - `durationHrs` — hours from creation to resolution / rejection; `null` while in progress
  - `teamSizeByHod` — active users reporting to each HOD (keyed by HOD empId)
}
